{"data":[{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-09T06:33:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108445849516933485"],"id":"2108445849516933485","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3979,"like_count":125,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":73,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你早上打开X是我，中午打开X是我，晚上打开群X还是我，我得不到你的人也要得到你的眼睛🤓","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2108445849516933485"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:51:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108420136999002377"],"id":"2108420136999002377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3151,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这大学真应该叫俺奶来读\n\n每天刚蒙蒙亮，先到操场跑上两圈。清早风凉，跑出一身薄汗，浑身筋骨都松开了。回宿舍冲个澡，再去食堂简简单单吃个早饭，一碗热粥，几个馒头，就一碟咸菜。不用慌慌张张赶点，踱着步子就去上早八了。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2108420136999002377"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:14:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108410855767638265"],"id":"2108410855767638265","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8367,"like_count":86,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":6},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108382626558156825","type":"quoted"}],"text":"做的时候真的不会突然笑出声吗🤓🥵 https://t.co/3KMHIlzFhg","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2108410855767638265"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:11:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108409970303828462"],"id":"2108409970303828462","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1998,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你们帅不帅我不知道啊，反正我一出现，空气就变得有点清澈。不是那种刻意摆出来的帅，而是站在那里就很少年。眉眼干净，神情松弛，笑起来的时候带着一点不设防的真诚，像阳光落在水面上，晃得人心里发亮。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2108409970303828462"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:10:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108409866087997816"],"id":"2108409866087997816","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4207,"like_cou